{"id":"vod_md_8091","vodId":"8091","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"吹响！悠风号第三季","name_cn":"吹响！悠风号第三季","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20240404-1/545f7fd5dde19ccbaccd3e52ec402c6a.jpg"},"summary":"春。北宇治高校吹奏楽部の3年、\r\n部长黄前久美子抱有期待和不安。\r\n会有什么样的新社员来，\r\n作为部长能把大家团结在一起吗，\r\n而且能否达成夙愿的目标--“全国大赛金奖”--\r\n久美子怀着这样的想法，过着作为部长奔走的日子，\r\n作为演奏者，久美子面前也出现了一堵大墙。\r\n黑江真由从参加全国大赛的常客强校转校过来。\r\n手中的乐器和久美子一样--尤福尼安。\r\n华丽的音色，卓越的演奏技巧；\r\n而且以温和的人品受到周围人的爱慕，是完美的少女。\r\n但是，在这样的真由偶尔露出的影子里，\r\n久美子抱有难以形容的感情。\r\n“我觉得他是社团活动，也不是勉强自己紧紧抱住的……“”\r\n久美子到底要如何面对真由呢……\r\n然后，“毕业”即将来到挂在吹奏乐上的青春--\r\n“走吧，每个人”\r\n久美子，高中最后一年开始！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-07-01 13:22:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240403/0VJk0NrR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240405/gthGDdzD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240421/l0VP032f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240428/AmcnkFJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240505/cIQDsATy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240512/2Or2yM9x/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240519/7FDFjV3A/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240526/Iao3RJ2Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240602/2CefQHHY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240609/e2xsqm0S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240616/fhZT5yNc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240623/8J4rOGwV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx12.com/20240701/o2x8PbmX/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:46.164Z"}